  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融創新與資料科學",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL INNOVATION AND DATA SCIENCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程藉由金融創新思維和資料分析工具，引導學生以不同的角度切入傳統的金融業務範疇。除了介紹金融創新的基本觀念和國內外案例之外，本課程將介紹數據和文字資料的搜尋、清洗、建置和分析，透過完整的資料分析過程，提供學生以客觀的方式解讀金融科技相關議題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will cultivate students to interpret the financial issues through the concept of financial innovation and data analysis. The search, clean, implement and analysis of data will be introduced. Through the complete data and text data analysis process, it will provide students the objective way to interpret the financial technology issues.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
